{"unit_id":"EditTogether__DSH-EditApart#feature-video-shot-inventory","repo":"EditTogether/DSH-EditApart","commit":"49efcae08c2348635c6d4bbd3132d0b16f84d0e1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**EditApart** 的功能「视频镜头清单」：对输入视频检测镜头边界并返回镜头编号、起止时间和时长。调用 inventory 工具并提供视频路径；可调整切点阈值和最短镜头时长。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugins/edit-apart.mjs:126","bin/edit_apart_core.py:147"]}
{"unit_id":"EditTogether__DSH-EditApart#feature-video-edit-loop","repo":"EditTogether/DSH-EditApart","commit":"49efcae08c2348635c6d4bbd3132d0b16f84d0e1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**EditApart** 的功能「视频方案生成与修订」：根据镜头清单和编辑规则提出候选剪辑方案，渲染为视频，再通过评估和 revise 工具调整方案。输入素材、方案和规则，输出可渲染的编辑决策及成片。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugins/edit-apart.mjs:180","plugins/edit-apart.mjs:152","bin/edit_apart_core.py:902","bin/edit_apart_core.py:1227"]}
{"unit_id":"EditTogether__DSH-EditApart#feature-photo-edit","repo":"EditTogether/DSH-EditApart","commit":"49efcae08c2348635c6d4bbd3132d0b16f84d0e1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**EditApart** 的功能「照片编辑流程」：分析单张图像后可提出包含裁剪、调色、文字叠加、缩放或锐化的方案，渲染并按评估结果修订。输入照片和编辑规则，输出处理后的图像。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugins/edit-apart.mjs:326","plugins/edit-apart.mjs:337","plugins/edit-apart.mjs:365","bin/photo_core.py:552"]}
